        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2102, Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Privacy Pocket Door Lock by Emtek is an all-in-one set designed to add a privacy function to your sliding pocket doors. Privacy locks latch and have an emergency turn release on the exterior. The Solid Brass Pocket Door Privacy Lock is available in a huge selection of finish color options. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick pocket doors. The Pocket Door Privacy Lock has a built in flip out edge pull to get the sliding door out of its pocket. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 2102 Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Emergency lock release on outside.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2102-instructions.pdf?v=1704262423\"><b>Emtek 2102 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
