                "description": "The Privacy Pocket Door Lock by Emtek is an all-in-one set designed to add a privacy function to your sliding pocket doors. Privacy locks latch and have an emergency turn release on the exterior. The Solid Brass Pocket Door Privacy Lock is available in a huge selection of finish color options. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick pocket doors. The Pocket Door Privacy Lock has a built in flip out edge pull to get the sliding door out of its pocket.",
